+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account's activity timeline: cards being added, assigned, moved, renamed, closed, or commented on.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated, flat list of activity from the boards you have access to, newest first. Results can be filtered using query parameters.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the user ID(s) who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+The following actions are included:
+
+| Action | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_published` | A card was added |
+| `card_assigned` | A card was assigned to someone |
+| `card_unassigned` | Someone was unassigned from a card |
+| `card_title_changed` | A card was renamed |
+| `card_board_changed` | A card was moved to another board |
+| `card_triaged` | A card was moved into a column |
+| `card_sent_back_to_triage` | A card was moved back to "Maybe?" |
+| `card_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" |
+| `card_auto_postponed` | A card was moved to "Not Now" due to inactivity |
+| `card_closed` | A card was moved to "Done" |
+| `card_reopened` | A card was reopened |
+| `comment_created` | A comment was added to a card |
+
+Each activity includes:
+
+- `description`: a plain-text sentence describing the activity, worded for the current user (e.g. "David will handle..." when you are the assignee). Names and card titles in it are HTML-escaped.
+- `url`: for card activity, opens the card. For comment activity, opens the card and jumps to the comment.
+- `eventable_type`: either `Card` or `Comment`.
+- `eventable`: the card or comment, using the same representation as the [cards](cards.md) and [comments](comments.md) endpoints.
+- `board` and `creator`: the board and the user who performed the activity, using the same representation as the [boards](boards.md) and [users](users.md) endpoints.
+- `particulars`: details that depend on the `action`:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: IDs of the assigned or unassigned users |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board` and `new_board`: names of the boards the card moved from and to |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title` and `new_title`: the card title before and after the change |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: name of the column the card moved to |
+
+Other actions return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
